{{Passive skill box|Essence Glutton}}

'''Essence Glutton''' is a Notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Necromancer]] that grants [[energy shield]] and [[mana]] [[regeneration]] per nearby corpse to you and nearby allies, plus additional energy shield and mana regeneration to you if you've consumed a corpse in the past 2 seconds.

==Ruthless mode==
{{infocard
|header    = Essence Glutton (Ruthless)
|subheader = Ascendancy Notable Passive Skill
|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:EssenceGlutton (Necromancer) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = Regenerate 4% of Mana over 2 seconds when you Consume a corpse<br>Regenerate 8% of Energy Shield over 2 seconds when you Consume a corpse
}}

Essence Glutton in [[Ruthless mode]] does not grant energy shield and mana regeneration for you and allies based on the number of nearby corpses.

